{"unit_id":"jinsiyu__dsh-code-server-app#feature-1","repo":"jinsiyu/dsh-code-server-app","commit":"7fdb8b70d8211403e0b8accdfc79ac7729bb687d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Code Server 的功能「侧栏 IDE」：在 DSH 右侧栏运行 VS Code，可从 loopback 或 DSH 路径访问，并支持全屏及标签切换后保持常驻。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:128-144","lib/serve-dsh.mjs:68-86"]}
